WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:03.670
-It is time for
the mimic challenge!

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.939
-♪ Mimic challenge ♪

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:09.609
♪ Mimic, mimic challenge, yeah ♪

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:13.245
-And here to help me out is
the one and only Maya Rudolph,

00:00:13.245 --> 00:00:14.514
ladies and gentlemen.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:17.550
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:18.851
Here's how it works.

00:00:18.851 --> 00:00:20.887
We each have a bunch of items
to make noise with,

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:23.456
and we're going to take turns
making a sound with an object.

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:26.291
Then the other person has to
immediately match that sound

00:00:26.291 --> 00:00:28.428
as precisely as they can.

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:29.862
Are you ready for this?

00:00:29.862 --> 00:00:31.897
-Absolutely.
-Okay, good.

00:00:31.897 --> 00:00:34.533
Maya, I will be the first --
I will make the first noise.

00:00:34.533 --> 00:00:36.568
Okay. Maya?
-Okay.

00:00:36.568 --> 00:00:40.340
-Make -- Make this sound.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.308
[ Key clacking ]

00:00:46.345 --> 00:00:48.014
[ Blowing sharply ]

00:00:48.014 --> 00:00:50.249
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.249 --> 00:00:51.718
That's pretty good.
I like that.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:53.720
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.488
-Okay.

00:00:55.488 --> 00:00:56.656
You ready?
-Alright, my turn.

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:58.490
Yeah, whenever you're ready.
-Ready, Jimmy?

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:00.527
-Are you supposed to, like,
not see what I'm doing?

00:01:00.527 --> 00:01:02.495
-I'm not gonna look, but --
I don't know.

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:04.463
-This is really complicated.

00:01:04.463 --> 00:01:06.032
-Okay.
-Alright, ready?

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:07.566
Jimmy, make this sound.

00:01:07.566 --> 00:01:09.668
[ Tissue whooshes ]

00:01:09.668 --> 00:01:12.138
-Can you do it again?

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:14.607
[ Tissue whooshes ]

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:15.608
[ Exhales sharply ]

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:16.776
-Yeah, that was it.

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:18.244
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:20.780
-Maya?
-Yes, sir.

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:23.683
-Make this sound.
-Okay.

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:26.453
[ Milk gurgling ]

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:30.557
[ Laughs ]

00:01:30.557 --> 00:01:32.425
Okay.

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:33.960
[ Sputtering ]

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:35.495
Wait, wait.

00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:36.762
-What?

00:01:36.762 --> 00:01:38.097
What?
-Wait.

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:39.966
-This sound.

00:01:39.966 --> 00:01:42.402
[ Milk gurgling ]

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:44.504
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.472 --> 00:01:50.076
[ Coughing ]
-Okay.

00:01:50.076 --> 00:01:52.445
[ Chortling softly ]

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:57.950
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:01.187
-[ Laughing ]
Okay, that was good.

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:03.656
-Oh, good news, Jimmy,
I got another one.

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:05.391
-Gotcha. Alright,
now I can see it.

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:06.725
-Alright, Jim.

00:02:06.725 --> 00:02:08.460
[ Laughing ] What? Jimmy.

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:09.828
-Jim. You can call me Jim.

00:02:09.828 --> 00:02:11.797
-Jim. It's Jim. It's Jim today.

00:02:11.797 --> 00:02:12.831
-It's Jim today. I got it.

00:02:12.831 --> 00:02:15.468
-Alright, James,
make this sound.

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:16.970
[ Tape screeches ]

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:19.105
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.507 --> 00:02:23.042
[ Whooshes ]

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:24.944
Maya.
-That was accurate.

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:27.613
♪♪

00:02:27.613 --> 00:02:31.250
-Mm-hmm?
-Maya, make this sound.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:35.188
[ Clicking, water squirting ]

00:02:35.188 --> 00:02:38.023
-[ Exhaling sharply ]
[ Water squirting ]

00:02:38.023 --> 00:02:39.058
[ Exhaling sharply ]

00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:40.493
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.493 --> 00:02:43.262
♪♪

00:02:43.262 --> 00:02:44.830
You had the face.

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:47.400
"Psst."
-It was -- It had an attitude.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:50.103
-It did have an attitude.
-"Pfft."

00:02:50.103 --> 00:02:51.737
-Okay, ready?
-Yes.

00:02:51.737 --> 00:02:53.339
-Alright, Jimmy.
-Here we go.

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:55.508
-Make this sound.
-Mm-hmm.

00:02:55.508 --> 00:02:57.544
[ Clattering ]

00:03:03.683 --> 00:03:06.485
-[ Laughs ] That's very good.

00:03:06.485 --> 00:03:09.655
That was...perfect.

00:03:09.655 --> 00:03:11.557
-Maya...
-Perfect. Yes, sir.

00:03:11.557 --> 00:03:14.726
-...make this sound.
-Okay.

00:03:14.726 --> 00:03:18.798
[ Toy squeaking nasally ]

00:03:18.798 --> 00:03:20.966
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.966 --> 00:03:22.802
[ Squeaking nasally ]

00:03:22.802 --> 00:03:25.404
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.404 --> 00:03:28.041
[ High-pitched ] "Uh,
sounds like me on prom night."

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:29.075
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.075 --> 00:03:30.276
[ Squeaking ]

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:31.877
-[ Groans ]

00:03:31.877 --> 00:03:34.214
[ Squeaking nasally ]

00:03:36.783 --> 00:03:39.419
[ Clucking ]

00:03:39.419 --> 00:03:41.053
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.053 --> 00:03:43.890
♪♪

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:45.725
[ Both chuckling ]

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:48.127
Holy -- Okay.

00:03:50.463 --> 00:03:52.364
-Wow.

00:03:52.364 --> 00:03:54.000
-It's -- This is normal.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.901 --> 00:03:57.437
Okay, Jimmy make this --

00:03:57.437 --> 00:03:59.104
[ Laughter ]

00:03:59.104 --> 00:04:01.307
This looks ridiculous.

00:04:01.307 --> 00:04:03.408
Okay, Jimmy, make this sound.

00:04:03.408 --> 00:04:05.311
[ Bass guitar strums ]

00:04:08.381 --> 00:04:11.284
[ Low vocalizing ]

00:04:11.284 --> 00:04:12.284
[ Laughter ]

00:04:12.284 --> 00:04:15.721
It was like The Breeders.

00:04:15.721 --> 00:04:17.556
♪ A-ooh ♪
-♪ A-ooh-ah ♪

00:04:17.623 --> 00:04:19.992
-♪ A-ooh-ah ♪
-♪ A-ooh-ah ♪

00:04:19.992 --> 00:04:21.694
-Was that Breeders?

00:04:21.694 --> 00:04:23.095
-Yeah.

00:04:23.095 --> 00:04:26.732
-Maya Rudolph, make this sound.

00:04:26.732 --> 00:04:29.402
[ Drill whirring ]

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:33.872
-[ Chuckles ]

00:04:33.872 --> 00:04:37.376
[ Humming, whirring ]

00:04:37.376 --> 00:04:39.111
[ Drill whirring ]

00:04:39.111 --> 00:04:41.681
[ Humming, whirring ]

00:04:41.681 --> 00:04:45.418
♪♪

00:04:45.418 --> 00:04:47.152
-Okay.

00:04:47.152 --> 00:04:48.687
My turn.

00:04:48.687 --> 00:04:51.791
-Oh, it's your turn, alright.

00:04:51.791 --> 00:04:53.526
-I see it. Oh.

00:04:53.526 --> 00:04:55.128
-Okay, Jimmy, make this sound.

00:04:55.128 --> 00:04:56.229
-Gosh.

00:04:59.531 --> 00:05:01.534
[ Squeaking, squelching ]

00:05:01.534 --> 00:05:03.569
[ Laughter ]

00:05:03.569 --> 00:05:05.671
By the way,
that's not how you sit on a --

00:05:05.671 --> 00:05:07.006
Like, wow.

00:05:07.006 --> 00:05:10.009
-Here, maybe it's better
if I sit on it, right?

00:05:10.009 --> 00:05:12.311
-Probably.
-Stand by.

00:05:12.311 --> 00:05:13.679
I'm a professional.

00:05:13.679 --> 00:05:15.782
[ Laughter ]

00:05:17.583 --> 00:05:19.418
Okay, Jimmy, make this sound.
-Yep.

00:05:19.418 --> 00:05:20.553
[ Cushion squelches ]

00:05:20.553 --> 00:05:22.622
[ Laughter ]

00:05:22.622 --> 00:05:26.225
Uh...

00:05:26.225 --> 00:05:27.960
[ Blowing, sputtering ]

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:30.096
[ Laughter ]

00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:31.296
[ Air squelching ]

00:05:31.296 --> 00:05:32.631
-That's it. That's it.

00:05:32.631 --> 00:05:35.868
-Was it right?
[ Muttering indistinctly ]

00:05:35.868 --> 00:05:38.504
-Ooh, I really --
I went through these fast.

00:05:38.504 --> 00:05:39.672
-[ Laughs ]

00:05:39.672 --> 00:05:43.075
Alright. Here we go.

00:05:43.075 --> 00:05:45.110
Maya...
-Mm-hmm.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:46.946
-...make this sound.

00:05:50.583 --> 00:05:52.885
[ Goat screams ]

00:05:52.885 --> 00:05:54.220
[ Laughter ]

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:56.122
[ Goat screams ]

00:05:56.122 --> 00:05:57.757
[ Laughter ]

00:05:57.757 --> 00:05:59.859
[ Goat screaming ]

00:06:02.027 --> 00:06:04.897
-[ Strained scream ]

00:06:04.897 --> 00:06:07.500
[ Goat screams ]

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:09.268
[ Both shrieking ]

00:06:09.268 --> 00:06:10.369
[ Bell dinging ]

00:06:10.369 --> 00:06:11.537
-Aah!

00:06:11.537 --> 00:06:13.005
My thanks to Maya Rudolph!

00:06:13.005 --> 00:06:15.774
Watch Maya host
"Saturday Night Live"

00:06:15.774 --> 00:06:18.211
this weekend
with musical guest Jack Harlow.

